# ── What IS committed ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# data/raw_csv/     ← 19 E. coli CSVs (688 KB, public data, Katipoglu-Yazan 2023)
# data/metaData.csv ← dataset-level metadata
# R/                ← all application modules
# app.R             ← Shiny entry point
# README.md         ← documentation
# www/              ← static assets (images, CSS)
# inst/             ← installation helpers
# Dockerfile        ← container definition
